summary: Test for memory online/offline hotplug
description: |
    Description:

    This test tries to test Memory soft hotplug

    a) Basic: Tries offline and online each memory module.

    b) Continous: This test tries to offline or online random memory
                  modules for ~10 min (see CONTIME variable) while ebizzy
                  produces 50% load on the total memory in the system. (This section is not complete)

    PASS on no kernel panic or kernel oops or no failure to offline/online memory
contact: Li Wang <liwang@redhat.com>
component:
  - kernel
test: ./runtest.sh
framework: beakerlib
recommend:
  - numactl
duration: 2h
extra-summary: /kernel/general/memory/function/memsofthotplug
extra-task: /kernel/general/memory/function/memsofthotplug

# ---------------------
# Filter definitions   |
# ---------------------

tier: '2'

tag:
  - tier2
  - NoRHIVOS
  - VMM_FUNCTION
